  "created": "2024-03-25T16:11:47.661Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "This bug seems to be a rare one, but if you start preloading a world but you also accept an invite or join a different world that's not the one you're preloading, the game will give a black screen and will take a long time to join the lobby or puts the game on a infinite \"initializing world\" loop which means you will need to restart the game.\n\nHow to replicate:\n\n1. Select World A and start preloading that world.\n\n2. Join World B while preloading World A in the background.\n\nWhat I haven't tested yet:\n\n- Replicating Step 2 but joining World A while it's still preloading.",
